# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ShiftedTone - example environment file (PLACEHOLDERS ONLY - safe to commit)
#
# Copy to `.env.local` for local development. `.env.local` is gitignored and
# must never be committed.
#
# SECRETS POLICY - IMPORTANT:
#   Private keys (dotenvx / DOTENV_PRIVATE_KEY, JWT_PRIVATE_KEY), JWT values
#   (JWKS), and all deployment credentials (VLY_INTEGRATION_KEY, etc.) must be
#   configured through the deployment secrets manager - the project's
#   Keys/API keys UI, the Convex dashboard environment variables, or your
#   host's (Vercel) Environment Variables settings.
#   They must NEVER be committed to Git. This file never contains real values.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Frontend (Vite build-time; these become public to the browser) -------
# Convex deployment URL the browser talks to.
VITE_CONVEX_URL=https://<your-deployment>.convex.cloud

# Optional analytics: Plausible site domain. Absent = tracking is a no-op.
VITE_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN=<your-production-domain.example>

# Optional: only if you self-host Plausible or proxy its script.
# VITE_PLAUSIBLE_API_HOST=https://<plausible-host.example>

# --- Backend / server-side (values live in the secrets manager) -----------
# Public origin used for auth callbacks and CORS. Not secret, but set per env.
# CONVEX_SITE_URL=https://<your-production-domain.example>
# SITE_URL=https://<your-production-domain.example>

# Convex Auth key material - SET VIA THE SECRETS MANAGER, NEVER COMMITTED:
#   JWKS                 (JWT verification keys)
#   JWT_PRIVATE_KEY      (JWT signing key)
#   VLY_INTEGRATION_KEY  (platform integrations deployment token)
#
# dotenvx users: the DOTENV_PRIVATE_KEY never belongs in this repo.
# The dotenvx key file in the project root is a comments-only guard file;
# see SECURITY.md and LAUNCH.md section 0 (key rotation runbook) for why.
